 "notes": "20th edition. Survey: Global Risks Perception Survey 2024-2025, over 900 respondents, 33 risks. Same severity method as 2023-2024: 1-7 scale over 2 and 10 years, ranked by mean (Figure C, top 10 each). Risk list and labels changed again (for example 'Cyber espionage and warfare', 'Inequality', 'State-based armed conflict'). METHOD CHANGE in the current-year question: respondents select ONE risk (2024: up to five), so shares are not comparable with 2024. Current-year entries are the top 7 of 33 bars in Figure B; values are whole percentages as printed. Category read from the figure colour key."
